    "created_at": "2015-09-02T16:08:38Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-09-02T16:08:38Z",
    "body": "There's a few separable things in this area. E.g. https://drafts.csswg.org/css-forms/ takes care of some of it. The existing text in that bindings section takes care of a lot of it (in a somewhat vague way, but also pretty helpful). But this issue I specifically meant to be about removing the idea that the `binding` CSS property has an impact.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
