    "created_at": "2015-09-02T21:29:38Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-09-02T21:29:38Z",
    "body": "Remove it, nobody's planning on doing anything like `binding` ever.  The Forms spec will, in the fullness of time, actually describe this stuff, but in the meantime no guidance is better than false guidance.\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
